"{{Term/Store|A Parent's Love||Series, BotW}}" is a [[Side Quest]] in {{BotW}}.<ref>{{Cite|{{Big|A Parent's Love}}<br/>{{Color BotW|Side Quest|Tarrey Town}}|Adventure Log|BotW}}</ref>

==Overview==
In [[Tarrey Town]], [[Link]] ocan come upon an argument between [[Ruli]] and her husband [[Hagie]] about their daughter [[Hunnie]]. However, if he tries to speak to them, Ruli will inform him that this is a personal matter and asks him to leave.<ref>{{Cite|I'm sorry... This is a very personal matter. Could you leave, please?|Ruli|BotW}}</ref>

To receive the [[Side Quest]], Link must listen in on Ruli and Hagie's conversation through their open window. Ruli laments that Hunnie is unwell and refuses to eat anything but cakes.<ref>{{Cite|Our daughter... The only thing she'll eat is {{Color BotW|Red|cake}}. Can't anything be done?|Ruli|BotW}}</ref> Hagie recalls that they have searched everywhere for a cake that could make her better and wonders how much money they have spent.<ref>{{Cite|We've scoured the world, searching for a cake that would please her. None have. Imagine how much money we've spent...|Hagie|BotW}}</ref> His words anger Ruli, who asks if he cares more about money or his daughter.<ref>{{Cite|Papa, excuse me!<br/>What's more important to you, money or our daughter?|Ruli|BotW}}</ref> Ruli declares that she is desperate to find a cure for Hunnie, even if she has to sell her soul to a monster.<ref>{{Cite|Even if I have to sell my soul to a {{Color BotW|Red|monster}}, I'll get my hands on a {{Color BotW|Red|cake}} that can cure our daughter!|Ruli|BotW}}</ref>

[[Link]] can deliver a [[Monster Cake]], made with [[Monster Extract]], to Ruli.<ref>{{Cite|What is... Is this a {{Color BotW|Blue|monster cake}}? I should give this to my daughter?|Ruli|BotW}}</ref> Though she is grateful to receive it, she notes its pungent odor.<ref>{{Cite|Thank you so much!<br/>Oh, wow. It's certainly quite pungent... Phew.|Ruli|BotW}}</ref> However, she realizes she can not complain, as it could help Hunnie get better.<ref>{{Cite|I suppose I can't complain about things like that. If our daughter can get better thanks to this cake...|Ruli|BotW}}</ref> She decides to have her eat it right away.<ref>{{Cite|I'll try to get her to eat it right away.|Ruli|BotW}}</ref><ref>{{Cite|I'll wake her up right away and try to get her to eat it.|Ruli|BotW}}</ref>

After eating the Monster Cake, Hunnie gets her energy back, and is able to play outside again.<ref>{{Cite|That {{Color BotW|Blue|monster cake}}... Our daughter wolfed it down with unbelievable gusto. It seems her health has returned to her!|Ruli|BotW}}</ref> As a way to thank him, Ruli rewards Link with a [[Gold Rupee]].<ref>{{Cite|I don't even know what to say-I'm just so thankful! Oh, I know. This isn't much, but please take it.|Ruli|BotW}}</ref>

